invariant: INV-14
file: srv.c
catches: tcp_blocking_loop_test
reason: ch_srv_accept no longer marks its session as a server's, so the
  session's ch_read takes a client's NewSessionTicket as a client would.
  bin/tcp_blocking_loop_test requires ch_srv_accept's session to refuse
  one with unexpected_message.

--- old
    t->server = 1; // what ch_read refuses a NewSessionTicket on (handshake_post.c)
--- new
